<title>NETHERLANDS: WESSELIUS UPGRADES DSM TO BUY, UPS 97 ESTS.</title>
<headline>WESSELIUS UPGRADES DSM TO BUY, UPS 97 ESTS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Oct 1 research flash.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>DSM		 Chemicals     168.00  Wesselius</p>
<p>COMMENT: Buy (from Hold). DSM poised to gain maximum benefit</p>
<p>from European economic growth which seen accelerating in 1997.</p>
<p>Significant reduction in cyclical exposure due to expansion in</p>
<p>fine chemicals. New stable dividend policy and share buyback</p>
<p>opportunities also seen buoying share price.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	pvs	P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1996		   22.74    22.74    7.4     8.00</p>
<p>    1997		   30.04    21.03    5.6     9.00</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
